  "properties": {
    "panels": [
      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-keep-or-redirect-7-ba2c3be6-4712-4e3d-8016-69fd81ac9220",
        "text": "First, you start with a plan for your web page.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/90c406a6db38b75113ede59d82566e53-adaptive-HoAI26-keep-or-redirect-7-panel-1-4502e179-ad54-492f-88e1-7ba569688744.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-keep-or-redirect-7-4f32facc-9d3a-417d-8506-7b147ed7a6e3",
        "text": "Then, compare the AI's result to your plan. See what matches and what doesn't.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/aa6f60fde4ecc2bb10f318a7dc3cdbb7-adaptive-HoAI26-keep-or-redirect-7-panel-2-d483f2f6-5e99-4d6a-8757-48a82ae3baed.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-keep-or-redirect-7-4e6e7a97-d8fc-4458-aa16-afc16e2b48c4",
        "text": "If the result is good, or close enough, you can simply keep it as is.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/bdeac1aa4a09c49e5c95a93fe1c4f9e3-adaptive-HoAI26-keep-or-redirect-7-panel-3-9ebcb81b-6a00-48a2-820d-03845357d2e6.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-keep-or-redirect-7-4d59d49f-ef73-4664-89c5-db39ed61e775",
        "text": "If it's way off, redirect with a new prompt. For small changes, edit it yourself by hand.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/f730af5c733bb6cee601971b564db619-adaptive-HoAI26-keep-or-redirect-7-panel-4-6a845602-19a2-45b7-ae41-52dda4c49923.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      }
    ],
    "generate_outline": "Watch a screen recording demonstrating how to evaluate AI output against a plan. Learn to identify matches and mismatches, then choose whether to keep the result, redirect with a new prompt, or edit by hand for small, exact changes."
  },
